 "name": "Filmed Screen",
 "name_id": "Layar Terfilmkan",
 "category": "camera",
 "description": {
  "id": "Adeganmu seolah difilmkan dari layar monitor di ruang gelap: perspektif 3D, sub-piksel LED, garis pindai, kilau kaca, bingkai, bidang fokus dangkal di tepi, dan warna per bidikan. Beberapa bidikan meluncur dari satu sudut ke sudut lain. Mode warp: satu sudut tetap dengan goyang pelan, cocok untuk cuplikan video.",
  "en": "Your scene filmed off a screen in a dark room: 3D perspective, LED sub-pixels, scanlines, glass sheen, bezel, shallow depth of field and per-shot colour grades, with shots gliding between angles. Warp mode holds a single angle with a gentle drift."
 },
